14:["$","h2",null,{"children":"Reading, data and corrections."}]
15:["$","p",null,{"children":"Daily editions use AI-assisted research, drafting and illustration. Each candidate goes through source retrieval, duplicate checks, an automated editorial review and publication checks. These checks can miss errors and are not a claim of human review. Archival social examples retain their original observation dates; proposed workflows are not presented as completed experiments. An edition that fails validation is held back."}]
16:["$","p",null,{"children":"Bookmarks are stored only in your browser. This publication creates no reader accounts and collects no subscription forms. Official social players load as you approach them in an article. TikTok or Instagram may process technical data and use cookies under their own policies; playback stays under your control. Hosting infrastructure may process technical data necessary to serve pages."}]
17:["$","p",null,{"children":["Product references are checked and dated alongside their examples. To report an editorial error, write to"," ",["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:contact@tokportal.com?subject=THE ORGANIC CLUB%20%E2%80%94%20correction","children":"contact@tokportal.com"}]," ","with the page URL and a source supporting the correction."]}]
18:["$","h2",null,{"children":"What we do not promise."}]
19:["$","p",null,{"children":"No guaranteed reach, assured indexing or automatic growth. We offer a readable framework for asking better questions and documenting answers."}]
